  hazardName: "\xC7al\u0131\u015Fan\u0131n malzeme ta\u015F\u0131rken g\xF6r\xFC\u015F
    mesafesinin kapanmas\u0131"
  description: "Elinizde bir \u015Feyler ta\u015F\u0131rken g\xF6r\xFC\u015F mesafesinin
    kapanmamas\u0131na dikkat etmek, y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015F yolundaki engelleri zaman\u0131nda
    fark ederek tak\u0131lma, \xE7arpma ve d\xFC\u015Fme gibi kazalar\u0131n \xF6n\xFCne
    ge\xE7er. Y\xFCk\xFC v\xFCcudu kapatmayacak \u015Fekilde konumland\u0131rmak
    ve gerekti\u011Finde b\xF6lerek ta\u015F\u0131mak hem g\xFCvenli\u011Fi hem de
    i\u015F ak\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131 korur."
